# Genghis Frog: "Whenever Genghis Frog or another Mutant you control enters, create a Mutagen token." Bot2 casts its Genghis Frog on
# turn 2 (its own Mutagen). On turn 3 Bot1 Lightning Bolts it and casts Supper for Spiders: the Frog comes back under Bot1's control as
# a Food artifact that has lost all other types and subtypes (CR 614.12) - no Mutant, but still Genghis Frog with its ability - so its
# "Genghis Frog ... enters" half triggers and Bot1 gets a Mutagen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Supper for Spiders
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Genghis Frog
Island x17

